{"about_the_game":"# GAMEPLAY<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Enemies fall down from up to down. So you must destroy them until they are not reached the guard line.<br />\r\n- Enemies have two colors(red and blue), so you have to match the same color to destroy them.<br />\r\n- There are Stage Mode and Endless Mode. Stage Mode have 3 Levels and Endless Mode is just one.<br />\r\n- This is not a Rhythm game. It's similar to fast reaction game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n# CONTROLS<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Red Blue is using only 4 keyborad to play the game.<br />\r\n- Left Arrow Key : Go Left<br />\r\n- Right Arrow Key : Go Right<br />\r\n- Up Arrow Key : Fire<br />\r\n- Down Arrow Key : Chage Color(Red to Blue or Blue to Red)<br />\r\n- And you can use two option keys. Space Bar is restart and ESC is return menu.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n# FEATURES<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Easy to learn, simple arcade style controls<br />\r\n- very simple rule, but hard to clear.<br />\r\n- It's good for your finger exercise and dynamic visual acuity.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"74a2d5e81347a45f546acd38d699fefcfa556cca.jpg","localized_name":"5 Games","name":"5 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/961410/74a2d5e81347a45f546acd38d699fefcfa556cca.jpg"},{"icon":"6f9862a47d624be42bf7a3372f4508bd45851166.jpg","localized_name":"30 Games","name":"30 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/961410/6f9862a47d624be42bf7a3372f4508bd45851166.jpg"},{"icon":"86d7fbc92d8216a865790cf261ea3dd7a34383ce.jpg","localized_name":"100 Games","name":"100 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/961410/86d7fbc92d8216a865790cf261ea3dd7a34383ce.jpg"},{"icon":"9c2f7b496514ca03b61b7863728e962c324b04fc.jpg","localized_name":"300 Games","name":"300 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/961410/9c2f7b496514ca03b61b7863728e962c324b04fc.jpg"},{